<article lang="<%= view.language %>" class="investor-report executive-report" data-investor-report="assets">
<% const t = view.t; const asset = report.asset; %>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="asset-snapshot">
<%- include('../partials/admin/report-header.ejs',{reportTitle:'ASSET REGISTER + VALUATION'}) %>
<p class="report-section-label"><%= t("01 / Executive Snapshot") %></p>
<h3><%= t("Recorded assets, at a glance") %></h3>
<p class="report-intro"><%= t("Recorded assets combine inventory at recorded cost (HPP) and active fixed assets at acquisition cost. Inventory retail value shows potential sales, separately from recorded asset value.") %></p>
<dl class="report-kpis">
<div class="report-kpi report-kpi--lead"><dt><%= t("Total Recorded Assets") %></dt><dd data-report-combined><%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Recorded asset value combines inventory at recorded HPP and active fixed assets at acquisition cost.") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Inventory at HPP") %></dt><dd data-report-hpp><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Capital represented by available inventory, based on the recorded cost per unit (HPP).") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Fixed Asset Acquisition Value") %></dt><dd data-report-fixed><%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Recorded purchase cost of active fixed assets, without depreciation. This is neither market value nor depreciated book value.") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Inventory Retail Value") %></dt><dd data-report-retail><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Potential sales value if the recorded inventory is sold at current prices. Sales are not guaranteed.") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Potential Gross Spread") %></dt><dd data-report-spread><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Retail value minus HPP for inventory with confirmed stock and cost. This is not net profit; operating expenses, discounts, payment and shipping fees, returns and tax are excluded.") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Known Inventory Units") %></dt><dd><span data-report-units><%= asset.knownUnits %></span> <small><%= view.unitLabel %></small></dd></div>
</dl>
<section class="report-block"><h3><%= t("Asset mix") %></h3>
<table class="report-summary-table" data-asset-mix><caption><%= t("Share of recorded inventory and fixed assets") %></caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Asset Class") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Value") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Share of Recorded Assets") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Inventory at HPP") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></td><td><%= view.inventoryShare %></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Fixed Assets") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %></td><td><%= view.fixedShare %></td></tr>
</tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Total Recorded Assets") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %></td><td><%= view.totalShare %></td></tr></tfoot></table>
</section>
</section>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="asset-position">
<p class="report-section-label"><%= t("02 / Inventory & Asset Position") %></p><h3><%= t("Inventory supports the commercial opportunity") %></h3>
<dl class="report-facts">
<div><dt><%= t("Total products") %></dt><dd data-product-count><%= view.productCount %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Known-stock products") %></dt><dd><%= view.knownStockProducts %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Products requiring stock confirmation") %></dt><dd><%= view.unknownStockProducts %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Known inventory units") %></dt><dd><%= asset.knownUnits %> <%= view.unitLabel %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Inventory HPP value") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Inventory retail value") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Potential gross spread") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd></div>
</dl>
<p class="report-takeaway"><%= t("Inventory retail value is a sales opportunity, not guaranteed revenue. Gross spread shows the room for margin before operating and selling costs; it is not net profit.") %></p>
<section class="report-block"><h3><%= t("Fixed asset base") %></h3>
<p class="report-emphasis"><strong><%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %></strong> <%= t("in active acquisition value across") %> <strong><%= view.activeFixedCount %> <%= t("active asset records") %></strong>.</p>
<p><%= t("Active fixed assets are shown at their recorded purchase cost. No depreciation or market valuation is applied. Disposed assets remain listed for reference but do not contribute to active asset value.") %></p>
</section>
<section class="report-block"><h3><%= t("Key valuation notes") %></h3><ul class="report-key-notes">
<li><%= t("Inventory uses recorded HPP/direct cost.") %></li><li><%= t("Fixed assets use recorded acquisition value.") %></li><li><%= t("Retail value is not recorded asset value.") %></li><li><%= t("Unknown stock/cost is excluded where applicable.") %></li><li><%= t("No depreciation or book value is calculated.") %></li>
</ul></section>
<nav class="report-appendix-index" aria-label="<%= t("Asset report appendices") %>"><h3><%= t("Supporting detail") %></h3><a href="#asset-appendix-a"><%= t("Appendix A — Detailed Inventory") %></a><a href="#asset-appendix-b"><%= t("Appendix B — Fixed Asset Detail") %></a><a href="#asset-appendix-c"><%= t("Appendix C — Basis of Valuation") %></a></nav>
</section>
<div class="report-appendices">
<section class="report-appendix" id="asset-appendix-a" data-report-wide data-report-appendix="A"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix A") %></p><h3><%= t("Detailed Inventory") %></h3>
<p><%= t("Includes inventory that has not been archived, including products still being prepared for sale. Archived products are excluded. Product names and SKUs are shown as recorded.") %></p>
<p data-report-incomplete><%= asset.incompleteCount %> <%= t("incomplete items:") %> <%= asset.unknownStockCount %> <%= t("with unspecified stock;") %> <%= asset.unknownCostCount %> <%= t("with unknown HPP. Missing data does not mean zero.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Inventory valuation") %>"><table class="report-inventory-table"><colgroup><col class="report-col-20" /><col class="report-col-15" /><col class="report-col-8" /><col class="report-col-6" /><col class="report-col-12" /><col class="report-col-13" /><col class="report-col-13" /><col class="report-col-13" /></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Product") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("SKU") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Stock Qty") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("HPP / unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Inventory value") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Selling price / unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Retail value") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of asset.inventory) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.product.name %></th><td><%= row.variant.sku %></td><td><%= row.variant.stockKnown ? row.variant.stockQuantity : t("Unknown stock") %></td><td><%= row.variant.unit ?? t("Not available") %></td><td class="report-money"><%= row.hpp === null ? t("Not available") : formatIdr(row.hpp) %></td><td class="report-money"><%= row.inventoryValue === null ? t("Not available") : formatIdr(row.inventoryValue) %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.variant.price) %></td><td class="report-money"><%= row.retailValue === null ? t("Not available") : formatIdr(row.retailValue) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope="row" colspan="2"><%= t("Known totals") %></th><td><%= asset.knownUnits %></td><td></td><td></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></td><td></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></td></tr></tfoot></table></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix report-appendix--new-page" id="asset-appendix-b" data-report-wide data-report-appendix="B"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix B") %></p><h3><%= t("Fixed Asset Detail") %></h3>
<p><%= t("Fixed assets are shown at recorded acquisition cost, without depreciation. These figures are not market values or depreciated book values. Disposed assets remain listed but are excluded from active totals.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Fixed asset valuation") %>"><table class="report-fixed-table"><colgroup><col class="report-col-30" /><col class="report-col-8" /><col class="report-col-8" /><col class="report-col-19" /><col class="report-col-23" /><col class="report-col-12" /></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Asset") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Quantity") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Acquisition cost / unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Total acquisition value") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Status") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of asset.fixed) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.assetName %></th><td><%= row.quantity %></td><td><%= row.unit %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.acquisitionCostPerUnit) %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.total) %></td><td><%= t(row.status) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope="row" colspan="4"><%= t("Active acquisition value") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %></td><td><%= t("Disposed excluded") %></td></tr></tfoot></table></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix report-appendix--new-page" id="asset-appendix-c" data-report-appendix="C"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix C") %></p><h3><%= t("Basis of Valuation") %></h3>
<dl class="report-methods"><dt><%= t("Inventory value") %></dt><dd><%= t("Inventory value = confirmed stock × recorded cost per unit (HPP). This is the capital represented by available inventory.") %></dd><dt><%= t("Retail value") %></dt><dd><%= t("Retail value = confirmed stock × current selling price. This is a potential sales value, not guaranteed revenue.") %></dd><dt><%= t("Potential gross spread") %></dt><dd><%= t("Gross spread = retail value minus HPP for inventory with both confirmed stock and recorded cost. Retail value used in this comparison:") %> <%= formatIdr(asset.comparativeRetail) %>.</dd><dt><%= t("Fixed acquisition value") %></dt><dd><%= t("Fixed asset value = quantity × recorded acquisition cost per unit or pack. Only active assets enter the total. Depreciation has not been deducted.") %></dd><dt><%= t("Combined recorded asset value") %></dt><dd><%= t("Recorded assets = inventory at HPP + acquisition cost of active fixed assets. Inventory retail value is shown separately and is not added to recorded assets.") %></dd><dt><%= t("Incomplete data") %></dt><dd><%= t("Unconfirmed stock or cost is excluded from calculations that require it. A confirmed zero is included as zero; missing data is not treated as zero.") %></dd></dl>
<ul class="report-key-notes"><li><%= t("Unconfirmed stock or cost is excluded from calculations that require it. A confirmed zero is included as zero; missing data is not treated as zero.") %></li><li><%= t("Unit counts and retail value require confirmed quantities. Inventory HPP and gross spread also require recorded costs. Where costs are incomplete, retail value can cover more inventory than the gross-spread calculation.") %></li><li><%= t("A product needs stock confirmation if any of its listed variants has an unconfirmed quantity. The fixed-asset count refers to asset records, not the number of individual units.") %></li><li><%= t("Displayed asset shares use recorded asset value as denominator and are rounded to two decimal places; no share is shown for a zero denominator.") %></li><li><%= t("Fixed assets follow the owner's classification. No depreciation, useful life, salvage value or book value is inferred.") %></li><li><%= t("Product names, asset names and SKUs are shown as recorded so investors can trace them to the underlying registers.") %></li><li><%= t("Incomplete product weights and photographs affect shipping and sales readiness, but do not change the recorded valuation basis.") %></li></ul>
</section></div>
</article>
